* Define component values here if needed
V1 vin 0 AC 1 * input AC source

MN1 4 3 2 2 NMOS * NMOS transistor:

R1 vin 3 1k * Resistor R1 between vin and node 3
R2 3 0 1k * Resistor R2 between node 3 and ground
RS 5 2 1k * Resistor RS between node 5 and node 2
RL 2 0 1k * Resistor RL between node 2 and ground

